{"sha": "bfb1b09e2d58522ae1f29882b7d8a88f891d6260c8acb02034c848418043f020", "body": ["\\chapter{代数与方程}\\label{ch:g9:algebra}", "", "字母代表数，用字母计算可以证明关于", "\\emph{所有}数同时成立的事实。本章练习展开与", "因式分解 --- 包括贯穿整个数学的三个恒等式 ---", "并求解一次方程、积式方程与简单不等式，", "每一步都有依据。", "", "\\section{展开}", "", "\\begin{definition}[展开]\\label{def:g9:algebra:expand}", "\\emph{展开}\\index{展开}是指利用分配律，将乘积化为", "和的形式：", "\\[", "k(a + b) = ka + kb,", "\\qquad", "(a + b)(c + d) = ac + ad + bc + bd .", "\\]", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g9:algebra:expand}", "第一个括号中的每一项都与第二个括号中的每一项相乘：", "\\begin{align*}", "(x + 3)(2x + 5)", "&= x \\times 2x + x \\times 5 + 3 \\times 2x + 3 \\times 5 \\\\", "&= 2x^2 + 5x + 6x + 15 \\\\", "&= 2x^2 + 11x + 15 .", "\\end{align*}", "符号随各项一同移动：", "\\begin{align*}", "(3x - 2)(x - 4)", "&= 3x^2 - 12x - 2x + 8", "= 3x^2 - 14x + 8 .", "\\end{align*}", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[三个恒等式]\\label{thm:g9:algebra:identities}", "对所有数 $a$ 与 $b$：", "\\[", "(a+b)^2 = a^2 + 2ab + b^2,", "\\qquad", "(a-b)^2 = a^2 - 2ab + b^2,", "\\qquad", "(a+b)(a-b) = a^2 - b^2 .", "\\]", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "分别展开每个等式的左边。对第一式，", "$(a+b)(a+b) = a^2 + ab + ba + b^2 = a^2 + 2ab + b^2$。对第二式，", "将第一式中的 $b$ 换为 $-b$。对第三式：", "$(a+b)(a-b) = a^2 - ab + ba - b^2 = a^2 - b^2$（交叉项相消）。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.60]", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) rectangle (5,5);", "  \\draw[thick] (3.3,0) -- (3.3,5);", "  \\draw[thick] (0,3.3) -- (5,3.3);", "  \\fill[omDef!14] (0,0) rectangle (3.3,3.3);", "  \\fill[omThm!14] (3.3,3.3) rectangle (5,5);", "  \\fill[omProp!14] (3.3,0) rectangle (5,3.3);", "  \\fill[omProp!14] (0,3.3) rectangle (3.3,5);", "  \\node[font=\\small] at (1.65,1.65) {$a^2$};", "  \\node[font=\\small] at (4.15,4.15) {$b^2$};", "  \\node[font=\\small] at (4.15,1.65) {$ab$};", "  \\node[font=\\small] at (1.65,4.15) {$ab$};", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (1.65,0) {$a$};", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (4.15,0) {$b$};", "  \\node[left, font=\\small] at (0,1.65) {$a$};", "  \\node[left, font=\\small] at (0,4.15) {$b$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 恒等式 $(a+b)^2 = a^2 + 2ab + b^2$，从面积看：边长为 $a+b$ 的大", "正方形由两个正方形和两个相等的长方形组成。", "忘记“$2ab$”，就等于忘了那两个长方形！}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g9:algebra:identities}", "\\[", "(x + 5)^2 = x^2 + 10x + 25, \\qquad", "(3x - 1)^2 = 9x^2 - 6x + 1, \\qquad", "(2x + 7)(2x - 7) = 4x^2 - 49 .", "\\]", "口算：$102^2 = (100 + 2)^2 = 10000 + 400 + 4 = 10404$，又", "$98 \\times 102 = (100-2)(100+2) = 10000 - 4 = 9996$。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{因式分解}", "", "\\begin{method}[因式分解]\\label{met:g9:algebra:factor}", "因式分解一个式子时，依次尝试：", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item \\emph{公因式}：$ka + kb = k(a + b)$，其中 $k$ 本身", "        可以是一个括号；", "  \\item \\emph{平方差}：$a^2 - b^2 = (a+b)(a-b)$；", "  \\item \\emph{完全平方}：$a^2 + 2ab + b^2 = (a+b)^2$（若中间项为", "        $-2ab$，则为 $(a-b)^2$）。", "\\end{enumerate}", "总要把结果展开来检验。", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g9:algebra:factor}", "\\emph{公因式：}", "$15x^2 + 10x = 5x \\times 3x + 5x \\times 2 = 5x(3x + 2)$。", "", "\\emph{公共括号：}", "\\[", "(x+2)(x-1) + (x+2)(3x+4) = (x+2)\\bigl[(x-1) + (3x+4)\\bigr]", "= (x+2)(4x+3).", "\\]", ""]}